OL,3,GNEWSAWoman eyes up next challenge after
OL,4,AIronman success
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Kent who completed an
OL,7,FIronman race after a serious injury has
OL,8,Fset her eyes on her next challenge.
OL,10,FCatherine Linney, 57, from Sevenoaks,
OL,11,Fplaced 11th out of 55 competitors in
OL,12,Fher age category at the Ironman World
OL,13,FChampionships in Hawaii with a time of
OL,14,F11 hours 42 minutes and 33 seconds.
OL,16,FIt followed a seven-month recovery from
OL,17,Fa boat accident in 2025 which
OL,18,Fjeopardised her training and resulted
OL,19,Fin an ankle stress fracture and an
OL,20,Fosteoporosis diagnosis.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
