OL,3,GNEWSAWoman eyes up next challenge after
OL,4,AIronman success
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe retired police officer told BBC
OL,7,FRadio Kent she wanted to qualify again
OL,8,Fand crack the top 10 in her age
OL,9,Fcategory for her 60th birthday in three
OL,10,Fyears' time.
